{"action": "str_replace", "description": "Adds visible credit balances row to the account visitor menu", "enabled": true, "execution_order": 10, "find": "\t\t\t\t\t<!--[XF:stats_pairs:above_points]-->", "modification_key": "oc_credits_account_menu", "replace": "\t\t\t\t\t<xf:if is=\"$xf.visitor.hasPermission('general', 'ocView')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<xf:foreach loop=\"$xf.visitor.oc_balances\" value=\"$ocBalance\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"pairs pairs--justified fauxBlockLink\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dt>{$ocBalance.title}</dt>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{ link('credits') }}\" class=\"fauxBlockLink-linkRow u-concealed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{$ocBalance.prefix}{$ocBalance.balance|number($ocBalance.decimals)}{$ocBalance.suffix}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</xf:foreach>\n\t\t\t\t\t</xf:if>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!--[XF:stats_pairs:above_points]-->", "template": "account_visitor_menu", "type": "public"}